<http://purl.org/co/size> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The number of item belonging to a collection."@en .
<http://purl.org/co/size> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "CO defines the size of a collection as the sum of the number of times entities that are part of the collection appear in it. This means that co:size considers how much each entity is involved by a particular collection, i.e.:\n- the size of the set {a, b, c} is three\n- the size of the bag [a, a, b, b, b, c] is five\n- the size of the list (a, b, c, b, a, b, c, c) is seven"@en .
<http://purl.org/co/size> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has size"@en .
<http://purl.org/co/size> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
